  "description": "\"It turns out I wasn't born with a dirt spoon.\"\n\nAt the end of my life at rock bottom, I discovered that my life—which was supposed to be that of a third-generation chaebol heir—had been completely swapped ! Just as I was about to give up everything in despair, I heard the annoying voice of an ancestral spirit, and I was sent back to before my life was turned upside down. I will not let this life be taken away. A true third-generation chaebol heir's challenge to manage the family business, starting from my rightful place!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852530), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14394458)",
